@startuml
title Admin - Get Customer List

actor Admin
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant Redis
participant MySQL

Admin -> Frontend: Open Customer Management
Frontend -> Backend: GET /customer

Backend -> Redis: Get_Customer_List_For_Admin

alt Cache Miss
    Redis --> Backend: null
    Backend -> MySQL: Get_Customer_List_in_MySQL_DB_for_Admin
    MySQL --> Backend: Customer list
    Backend -> Backend: Build response_array
    Backend -> Redis: Set cache (Customer list)
else Cache Hit
    Redis --> Backend: Cached customer list
end

Backend --> Frontend: Customer list
Frontend --> Admin: Display customers

@enduml
